  "display_title": "My Cocky Neighbor",
  "description": "Ji Soon-yi’s always been the type to keep to herself. All her hobbies are things she can enjoy alone, and she’s the happiest when she’s at home by herself. Except…her neighbor certainly isn’t the same. Nam Changlim may be a stud, but he has a different girl over every night and each time, Soon-yi can hear everything that’s going on between him and his female companion. Annoyed, she curses Changlim and wishes that he be turned into a cock if that’s all he can think about. Alas, she’d forgotten that she’d purchased a magic candle holder earlier on that day… And the very next morning, she wakes up to find a very disgruntled, very animate dildo at her door. Uh-oh. Soon-yi did think her neighbor was too cocky, but she didn’t mean for the curse to be so literal… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
